AI with F5](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/7ab4f8ec3c7b84878418863974dcc64f6241d212-1090x380.svg)\n\nRackspace boosts private cloud agility with virtualization\n\n\"By making it easy, with a trusted brand and a reasonable price point, F5 has a really strong value proposition today.\"\n\nBryan Litchford, Vice President of Private Cloud, Rackspace Technologies\n\n[Read the case study](/case-studies/rackspace-boosts-private-cloud-agility-with-virtualization)[See all case studies](/case-studies)\n\n![Rackspace boosts private cloud agility with virtualization](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/95a5e9af643aee80c140390a79671c06f1ea1c92-1200x675.png)\n\nDocusign delivers reliable contract management for 1 billion users\n\n\"The F5 solution bridges the gap between complex network demands and rapid deployment. We’re very pleased with the performance and the efficiency we get for our dollar.\"\n\nRich Gocheco, Senior Manager, Systems Engineering, Docusign\n\n[Read the case study](/case-studies/docusign-delivers-reliable-contract-management-for-1-billion-users)[See all case studies](/case-studies)\n\n![Docusign delivers reliable contract management for 1 billion users](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/e621c220c2f75d184dd3202ce6df1e586bdc3aa5-1107x391.png)\n\nA financial services firm ensures reliable AI data delivery\n\nA leading European asset manager learned the hard way that object storage alone cannot absorb the concurrency of AI workloads. After a client misconfiguration triggered a denial-of-service event, the firm deployed F5 solutions to ensure reliable, scalable, and high-performance S3 data delivery for AI model training.\n\n[Read the case study](/case-studies/a-financial-services-firm-ensures-reliable-ai-data-delivery)[See all case studies](/case-studies)\n\n![A financial services firm ensures reliable AI data delivery](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/4367109103b9916a36269267de11c928d3c5f239-1090x380.svg)\n\nA public safety agency secures AI data delivery with F5\n\nAutonomous platforms generate continuous vision and sensor data that a national public safety technology agency stores, transforms, and feeds into RAG services. F5 BIG-IP r4600 appliances sit in front of the agency’s Weka and VAST Data storage to secure and load balance that ingestion path, protecting data at the perimeter and ensuring reliably up-to-date data for AI applications.\n\n[Read the case study](/case-studies/a-public-safety-agency-secures-ai-data-delivery-with-f5)[See all case studies](/case-studies)\n\n![A public safety agency secures AI data delivery with F5](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/bee2c349dbe1dd873fb39daaafc1068b8da5e445-1090x380.svg)\n\n## Deliver and secure every app\n\n[![Frontline defense for frontier AI threats](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/c8c14ab6f798c045f118d1aa6a0be2d5ab8ce15d-1200x675.png/frontier-ai-og-1200x675.png)\n\nFrontline defense for frontier AI threats\n\nF5 hardens its own code with frontier AI models while protecting your apps, APIs, and AI models in the data path, blocking zero-day and emerging AI-driven threats at runtime.](/frontier-ai-defense)\n\n[![Digital sovereignty is reshaping application strategy](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/386415ab93fea2b7159ae3d2b6c3bb5de4e07ea7-1200x675.png/digital-sovereignty-og.png)\n\nDigital sovereignty is reshaping application strategy\n\nLearn how F5 supports digital sovereignty with adaptable application strategies, ensuring compliance without fragmenting delivery, security, or operations.](/products/f5-application-delivery-and-security-platform/digital-sovereignty)\n\n[![Deliver and secure enterprise AI at the speed of inference](https://cdn.studio.f5.com/images/k6fem79d/translations-production/b61ff8f2ea43ceb86b740375c359bcee5b17bf65-1200x675.pn